                                "sense_id": "969eccc0-4e95-3965-851d-5ccf71904773",
                                "text": "Flood has paired up with associate professor Adream Blair and a group of undergrads taking a design course in the Digital Craft Research Lab at UWM, which along with the Milwaukee Makerspace community has paid for the project."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d719e015-c318-4d17-b99e-35ef8bb17b40",
                                "sense_id": "969eccc0-4e95-3965-851d-5ccf71904773",
                                "text": "In keeping with the spirit of the U.S. Air Force's motto \"Aim High\" Dr. Valerie Adream Smartt Short has set her sights on the state's highest office."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e26fa8d-c56f-4524-a4f6-f32cd330f0ab",
                                "sense_id": "969eccc0-4e95-3965-851d-5ccf71904773",
                                "text": "Adream Reese, 42, of Dallas snapped photos of the store’s sign before the fence covered the view. She said she hopes they’re doing something positive in memory of Hussle. She brought her 17-year-old son to be in a space where the rapper and community activist sold CDs in his youth."
